      GraphCert.Quartic.Polynomial.value F x y * GraphCert.Quartic.Polynomial.value starA_6 x y + values x y 6 * GraphCert.Quartic.Polynomial.value starB_6 x y :=
  identity_power (neighbors 6) nodes (constants 6) F starA_6 starB_6 root_6 6 1 4 (by decide +kernel) x y

