    (4 : G)^4 * rowProduct (neighbors 40) (values x y) (constants 40) - GraphCert.Quartic.Polynomial.value root_40 x y ^ 4 =
      GraphCert.Quartic.Polynomial.value F x y * GraphCert.Quartic.Polynomial.value starA_40 x y + values x y 40 * GraphCert.Quartic.Polynomial.value starB_40 x y :=
  identity_power (neighbors 40) nodes (constants 40) F starA_40 starB_40 root_40 40 4 4 (by decide +kernel) x y

